<!--
    Default (English) string catalogue.

    Everything the user can read lives here; the code never hardcodes UI text. Two rules apply
    throughout:

    * strings fed to the *model* (tool descriptions, tool-result errors) are deliberately NOT
      here — they are part of the wire protocol and must stay English. See AgentTools/AgentEngine.
    * anything with a format argument uses positional placeholders (%1$s), so a translation may
      reorder them.
-->
